	<id>access_matrix</id>
	<name>Access Matrix</name>
	<summary>Access matrix for Nextcloud applications by group</summary>
	<description><![CDATA[Administrative access matrix for Nextcloud.

Shows an "application × group" matrix and lets an administrator grant or revoke
access to an application with a single click, instead of typing group names by
hand in "Settings → Apps → ⋯ → Allow access for users in certain groups".

Restrictions are stored in the standard Nextcloud mechanism (the application
`enabled` appconfig key), so the matrix and the built-in administration
interface always show the same data.]]></description>
